# Play test of the plan 'The Abyss Expedition' (CIPlay plan_abyss, in a test world 'CI ...'): each island comes near
# the one before when its quest is done (or, for the generated sunken island and wreck, when players reach them), and
# is played to its end with its own test.
plan The Abyss Expedition
arrive mine
include old_mine_islet.play
arrive shelter
include shelter_atoll.play
arrive sunken
stand
arrive caverns
include ironreef_caverns.play
arrive wreck
stand
arrive city
include drowned_metropolis.play
arrive abyss
include the_abyss.play
plan end
